  "language": "fr"
}
```

**Response (202):**
```json
{
  "task_id": "uuid",
  "session_id": "string",
  "status": "queued",
  "message": "Requête en cours de traitement..."
}
```

### GET `/api/v1/agent/status/{task_id}`
